{"schemaVersion":1,"id":496,"sections":[{"id":"1915001-PROLOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战前","scripts":[20670],"start":0,"count":33},{"id":"1915001-EPILOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战后","scripts":[20671],"start":33,"count":33}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1915001-PROLOGUE:20670:1","scriptId":20670,"text":"超距攻击发动之后，敌人的攻势变得非常薄弱，而且又回到了之前单一的攻击模式。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1915001-PROLOGUE:20670:2","scriptId":20670,"text":"我们开始准备撤离并寻找补给，但考虑到不能让安妮一个人留在那里，于是就只有我和佐伊返回了最近的中继站。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1915001-PROLOGUE:20670:4","scriptId":20670,"text":"中继站的联络室中——","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1915001-PROLOGUE:20670:5","scriptId":20670,"text":"除了补给弹药之外，还通知了兰布达过来拿收集好的波谱坐标集。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1915001-PROLOGUE:20670:6","scriptId":20670,"text":"“嗯，这就是我要的东西。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":56,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1915001-PROLOGUE:20670:7","scriptId":20670,"text":"兰布达收起了波谱坐标集。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":56,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1915001-PROLOGUE:20670:8","scriptId":20670,"text":"“让我也看看～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":56,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1915001-PROLOGUE:20670:9","scriptId":20670,"text":"只是没想到连波西娅也跟着来了……","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":56,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1915001-PROLOGUE:20670:10","scriptId":20670,"text":"“果然是柯西她们，你们要小心应对，她们可不像我这么好说话。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":56,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1915001-PROLOGUE:20670:11","scriptId":20670,"text":"“是的……已经和她们交战过了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":56,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1915001-PROLOGUE:20670:12","scriptId":20670,"text":"“其实我也不太想暴力解决……你能不能帮个忙和她们交涉一下？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":56,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1915001-PROLOGUE:20670:13","scriptId":20670,"text":"“不要得寸进尺，我没有义务帮你们到这个地步。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":56,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1915001-PROLOGUE:20670:14","scriptId":20670,"text":"“也是……这次你已经帮了我们很多，不能让你太为难。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":56,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1915001-PROLOGUE:20670:15","scriptId":20670,"text":"“哼，知道就好。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":56,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1915001-PROLOGUE:20670:16","scriptId":20670,"text":"既然兰布达表示无法继续给与帮助，那只能按原计划进行。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":56,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1915001-PROLOGUE:20670:17","scriptId":20670,"text":"“那么波西娅，我们正好找你有事……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":56,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1915001-PROLOGUE:20670:18","scriptId":20670,"text":"这个时候波西娅不知道从哪里冒了出来。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":56,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1915001-PROLOGUE:20670:19","scriptId":20670,"text":"“你们还没搞定吗？我看刚才超远距离火炮都发射了呢。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1915001-PROLOGUE:20670:20","scriptId":20670,"text":"“是啊……遇到了点麻烦。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1915001-PROLOGUE:20670:21","scriptId":20670,"text":"我们把情况也向波西娅解释了一下。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1915001-PROLOGUE:20670:22","scriptId":20670,"text":"“啊哈？坐标？那超距离火炮又可以派上用场了啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1915001-PROLOGUE:20670:23","scriptId":20670,"text":"“不过我需要整备一下。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1915001-PROLOGUE:20670:24","scriptId":20670,"text":"“希望能够快点。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1915001-PROLOGUE:20670:25","scriptId":20670,"text":"“作为测试费用的话，我会算你们便宜点的。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1915001-PROLOGUE:20670:26","scriptId":20670,"text":"“那可真是太感谢了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1915001-PROLOGUE:20670:27","scriptId":20670,"text":"“……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":56,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1915001-PROLOGUE:20670:28","scriptId":20670,"text":"（我这么做真的好么？好像有点出卖柯西和奥米克戎的感觉……）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":56,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1915001-PROLOGUE:20670:29","scriptId":20670,"text":"虽然兰布的这么想着，但是她还是根据约定把波谱坐标集中解析出的坐标公开了。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":56,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1915001-PROLOGUE:20670:32","scriptId":20670,"text":"到达指定坐标——","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1915001-PROLOGUE:20670:33","scriptId":20670,"text":"这时候救助者1号开始闹腾了。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1134,"speaker":"救助者1号","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1915001-PROLOGUE:20670:34","scriptId":20670,"text":"“发现超强力磁场，系统发生紊乱……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":1134,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1915001-PROLOGUE:20670:37","scriptId":20670,"text":"与此同时一轮炮击向我们袭来……","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":1134,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":true},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1915001-PROLOGUE:20670:38","scriptId":20670,"text":"“看来只能先打一场了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":4,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":421,"speaker":"奥米克戎","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1915001-EPILOGUE:20671:1","scriptId":20671,"text":"“哼，这群猴子也想击溃我的磁力盾？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":421,"right":null,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1915001-EPILOGUE:20671:2","scriptId":20671,"text":"奥米克戎展开的磁力护盾，普通的炮击根本无法对据点造成损伤。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":421,"right":null,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":12,"speaker":"西格玛","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1915001-EPILOGUE:20671:3","scriptId":20671,"text":"“这……刚建好的据点就被发现了？怎么回事？？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":421,"right":12,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":430,"speaker":"柯西","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1915001-EPILOGUE:20671:4","scriptId":20671,"text":"“发生了点小状况。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":430,"right":12,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":421,"speaker":"奥米克戎","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1915001-EPILOGUE:20671:5","scriptId":20671,"text":"“可能马上会有更猛的炮击过来，我的磁力盾应该可以挡住。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":421,"right":12,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":12,"speaker":"西格玛","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1915001-EPILOGUE:20671:6","scriptId":20671,"text":"“我才不管你们想怎么样，这个据点本来就是为了隐秘而设立的！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":421,"right":12,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":12,"speaker":"西格玛","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1915001-EPILOGUE:20671:7","scriptId":20671,"text":"“既然被发现了，那只能放弃这个据点了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":421,"right":12,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":421,"speaker":"奥米克戎","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1915001-EPILOGUE:20671:8","scriptId":20671,"text":"“那我给你们争取点时间……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":421,"right":12,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1915001-EPILOGUE:20671:9","scriptId":20671,"text":"平时趾高气扬的奥米克戎也表现出了一丝愧疚。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":421,"right":12,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":12,"speaker":"西格玛","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1915001-EPILOGUE:20671:10","scriptId":20671,"text":"“柯西，过来帮我把东西运走。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":421,"right":12,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":430,"speaker":"柯西","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1915001-EPILOGUE:20671:11","scriptId":20671,"text":"“是。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":430,"right":12,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":430,"speaker":"柯西","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1915001-EPILOGUE:20671:12","scriptId":20671,"text":"（唉，又是体力活……）","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":430,"right":12,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1915001-EPILOGUE:20671:13","scriptId":20671,"text":"由于波西娅的超距离火炮支援，我们顺利攻下了坐标据点。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":430,"right":12,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1915001-EPILOGUE:20671:14","scriptId":20671,"text":"但该据点已经人去楼空，柯西和奥米克戎她们都已经撤离。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":430,"right":12,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1915001-EPILOGUE:20671:15","scriptId":20671,"text":"“这个东西就是权令台座吧？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":4,"right":12,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1915001-EPILOGUE:20671:16","scriptId":20671,"text":"因为不太懂旅行者的技术，所以又把兰布达给请来了。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":4,"right":12,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1915001-EPILOGUE:20671:17","scriptId":20671,"text":"“就是这个台座。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":4,"right":56,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1915001-EPILOGUE:20671:18","scriptId":20671,"text":"这是一个竖立在地上的蓝色台座，上面浮现着这一区域的地图。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":4,"right":56,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1135,"speaker":"安妮·沃佳诺娃","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1915001-EPILOGUE:20671:19","scriptId":20671,"text":"“唉？这个旅行者是……？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":4,"right":1135,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1915001-EPILOGUE:20671:20","scriptId":20671,"text":"显然安妮被兰布达给吓到了，一下子不知道怎么办。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":4,"right":1135,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1915001-EPILOGUE:20671:21","scriptId":20671,"text":"“让她把双手放上去。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":4,"right":56,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1915001-EPILOGUE:20671:22","scriptId":20671,"text":"“安妮，相信我，把双手放在这上面。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":4,"right":56,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1135,"speaker":"安妮·沃佳诺娃","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1915001-EPILOGUE:20671:23","scriptId":20671,"text":"“是。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":4,"right":1135,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1915001-EPILOGUE:20671:24","scriptId":20671,"text":"安妮把手放在了蓝色台座上之后，兰布达对着蓝色的台座进行了一番操作。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":4,"right":1135,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1915001-EPILOGUE:20671:25","scriptId":20671,"text":"“咔嚓”一声，安妮脖子上的迪塔格项圈掉落了下来。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":4,"right":1135,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1136,"speaker":"安妮·沃佳诺娃","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1915001-EPILOGUE:20671:26","scriptId":20671,"text":"“终于解开了！！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":4,"right":1136,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1915001-EPILOGUE:20671:27","scriptId":20671,"text":"“嗯，那么收工之前，先看看这里有没有什么值得带回去的。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":4,"right":1136,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1915001-EPILOGUE:20671:28","scriptId":20671,"text":"毕竟是旅行者的基地，自然少不了研究一番。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":4,"right":1136,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1915001-EPILOGUE:20671:29","scriptId":20671,"text":"（在我这个旅行者面前搜刮旅行者的基地……感觉有点不舒服，可能是我累了……）","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":4,"right":56,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1915001-EPILOGUE:20671:30","scriptId":20671,"text":"委托顺利完成——成功救回了失踪钢舞姬并摧毁了一个旅行者的基地。（虽然最终并没有多大发现）","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":4,"right":56,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1915001-EPILOGUE:20671:32","scriptId":20671,"text":"众人离开后——","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1133,"speaker":"菲尼克斯","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1915001-EPILOGUE:20671:33","scriptId":20671,"text":"“死水的指挥官果然名不虚传，但和他在一起的那个旅行者是怎么回事……？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":null,"right":1133,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1133,"speaker":"菲尼克斯","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1915001-EPILOGUE:20671:34","scriptId":20671,"text":"“看来还得找点机会继续观察他……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":null,"right":1133,"section":1,"shake":false}],"summaries":[]}
